# Compiled editor-core artifacts. These are build outputs, not source: CI
# builds them from the pinned Rust toolchain and they are published in the
# npm tarball. Run `npm run build:rust` (or `:ios` / `:android`) locally
# before any task that links them — the iOS test workspace, the example app,
# and the Android connected tests.
